  "short_window_rule": "7 full local days preceding cutoff, cutoff day excluded; descriptive summary with its own completeness flag (complete_7d), not used by the hot\u2013dry score",
  "baseline_definition": "Means and sample standard deviations of the 30-day mean of daily maximum temperature and 30-day rainfall total, grouped by grid cell and cutoff calendar month, among complete cutoff windows in the declared baseline years; at least 90% valid windows in every baseline year/month",
  "baseline_minimum_year_month_coverage": 0.9,
  "rainfall_method": "ARCO hourly precipitation, de-accumulated by ECMWF (verified equal to our CDS GRIB de-accumulation within GRIB packing precision). Rounding noise down to -0.001 mm becomes 0; more negative values remain missing. Interval ending at local midnight belongs to preceding day.",
